{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&quot;Welcome to Paradise, where every drink tastes like Heaven.&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062600/extras/16f54d73a6186c99fcbc518158ee4b16.avif?t=1773670412\" width=150 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>A Week in Paradise</u> is an introspective game that explores ideas between the lines of optimism, realism, and cynicism. You play through the eyes of a struggling writer, Damien. When stumbling into a bar called Paradise, you meet Charlene, a jazz singer who's falling into a rut of her own.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mysterious circumstances that connect your stories make you reflect on your regrets, ambitions, and relationships with each other as memories bubble to the surface. Hunt down additional clues in your dreams to untangle the mystery that ties you, this pub, and its sole patron, together. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices matter and heavily impact the conversations each day to unlock one of 5 endings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to move past your mistakes, or wallow in them?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062600/extras/ac756f886ce8d9aa9eccc0498df22d81.webp?t=1773670412\" width=62 height=97 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062600/extras/b61eb3f581d956bd0af535f414428034.webp?t=1773670412\" width=52 height=92 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062600/extras/99d8ae0cff5f9218643a022295910a3f.webp?t=1773670412\" width=59 height=92 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Features:</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choice-driven narrative: you decide the outcome by shaping the protagonist\u2019s perception.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotional themes: Trust, purpose, family? What\u2019s important to you?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ambient atmosphere: have a drink in the lounge at the quiet late night hours while you chat 'til morning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short and sweet: 1-3 hours of game play with replay-ability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cumulative Endings: Endings are not based on a single choice, but\u00a0the totality of your experience.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story interaction: sorting through your memories\u00a0takes effort.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4062600?t=1773670412","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062600/066d0c69b74c006b037197fa15422ebe6ff43730/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773670412","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062600/059307f3ab0c8edae860f13aeb649c19a8c484aa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773670412","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062600/059307f3ab0c8edae860f13aeb649c19a8c484aa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773670412","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Depictions of alcohol abuse, mild blood, insinuated tobacco use. Death is mentioned. "},"demos":[{"appid":4218320,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&quot;Welcome to Paradise, where every drink tastes like Heaven.&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062600/extras/16f54d73a6186c99fcbc518158ee4b16.avif?t=1773670412\" width=150 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>A Week in Paradise</u> is an introspective game that explores ideas between the lines of optimism, realism, and cynicism. You play through the eyes of a struggling writer, Damien. When stumbling into a bar called Paradise, you meet Charlene, a jazz singer who's falling into a rut of her own.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mysterious circumstances that connect your stories make you reflect on your regrets, ambitions, and relationships with each other as memories bubble to the surface. Hunt down additional clues in your dreams to untangle the mystery that ties you, this pub, and its sole patron, together. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices matter and heavily impact the conversations each day to unlock one of 5 endings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to move past your mistakes, or wallow in them?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062600/extras/ac756f886ce8d9aa9eccc0498df22d81.webp?t=1773670412\" width=62 height=97 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062600/extras/b61eb3f581d956bd0af535f414428034.webp?t=1773670412\" width=52 height=92